---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about SmartLukuFitness and the idea that being smart with your fitness, nutrition, and style can change how you show up in everyday life.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
      <h1>SmartLukuFitness is a Kenyan lifestyle brand about being intentional.</h1>
      <p>
        “Luku” is Nairobi Sheng for looking smart, dressing well, or throwing a good outfit. SmartLukuFitness takes that idea further. Being Smart Luku is about making intentional choices about your body, your food, and how you present yourself.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="container pillar-grid about-grid">
      <article class="pillar-card">
        <span class="card-kicker">Move smart</span>
        <h2>Fitness</h2>
        <p>We focus on practical movement, simple routines, and sustainable progress that fits busy real life.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pillar-card">
        <span class="card-kicker">Eat smart</span>
        <h2>Nutrition</h2>
        <p>We help you understand Kenyan foods, budget-friendly nutrition, and better daily eating choices without the noise.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pillar-card">
        <span class="card-kicker">Dress smart</span>
        <h2>Style &amp; Luku</h2>
        <p>We connect fitness and nutrition to personal presentation, confidence, and everyday polish.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="container about-story">
      <p>
        The goal is not perfection. It is practical self-improvement that fits work, family, budget, and everyday life. SmartLukuFitness is for people who want to feel stronger, eat better, and carry themselves with more confidence without the pressure of unrealistic trends or exaggerated promises.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
